\eqn{\hat u^*_{li}(z) = \hat u_i(z)(z_{li} - z_l)/h_l^2}, on the original
regressors. This is the result for a Gaussian kernel for the continuous
variables: \eqn{k\left(\frac{z_{li}-z_l}{h_l}\right) = \frac{1}{\sqrt{2\pi}}
